            "plain_text": "Offers students the means to approach wicked challenges grounded in their own interests from the lens of Systems and Cybernetics, and to receive credit for their work. (Note that “wicked” is used in a strict sense from design history, as when there is a lack of consensus, common frame, or shared values.)",
